==German==

===Etymology===
From Middle High German {{l|gmh|vrāge}}, from Old High German {{l|goh|forsca}}, from {{proto|Germanic|fregnanan}}, from {{proto|Indo-European|preḱ-|to ask}}. (cf. Gothic: ''frɛhnan'' {{rfscript|Gothic}}, Norwegian {{l|no|frega}}, Old English {{l|ang|frignan}}, Middle Persian ''pursīdan'', Old Persian ''fraθ-'',  Sanskrit {{term|पृच्छति|sc=Deva|tr=pṛccháti|lang=sa}}, Armenian {{term|հարց||tr=harc'|lang=hy}}, Latin {{term|posco|lang=la}}).

